For Gevherhan Sultan (daughter of Ahmed I):
Her father is Sultan Ahmed I, who reigned from 1603 to 1617. He was an Ottoman Sultan, and Gevherhan was his eldest daughter. She was also the half-sister of Sultan Osman II and the sister of Sultans Murad IV and Ibrahim.

For Gevherhan Sultan (daughter of Selim II):
Her father is Sultan Selim II, who reigned from 1566 to 1574. He was also an Ottoman Sultan, and Gevherhan was his daughter. She was the granddaughter of Suleiman the Magnificent and Hürrem Sultan, the sister of Sultan Murad III, and the aunt of Sultan Mehmed III.
